3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
What if this journey could be managed through one transparent digital platform?

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Introducing AnumatiSetu: Simplifying Permissions. Connecting People. Enabling Transparency.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,000
AnumatiSetu brings permission management into a unified digital environment.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:44,500
Its interface is designed to help users access role-based functions through an organized digital experience.

7
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:50,000
Let us explore the actual prototype and see how the workflow operates.

8
