12
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Search, notifications, statutory compliance tracking, and zero-reload multilingual navigation.

13
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Each feature shown here corresponds to an actual interface or interaction in AnumatiSetu.

14
