22
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:40,000
This demonstration focuses on the actual functions of the prototype, contributing to transparency.

23
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:47,000
AnumatiSetu is a step towards making permission management simpler, organized, and transparent.

24
